135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Rashtreeya Vidyalaya College of Engineering is one of the leading colleges in India and the top college in Karnataka. It has earned fame as one of the earliest self-financing colleges in Karnataka. The institution is run by the Rashtreeya Sikshana Samithi Trust \(RSST\). The trust runs over 25 institutions and RV College of Engineering is the flagship institute under their trust. Team Vyoma is affiliated to RV College of Engineering and functions as one of the technical teams present in the college. Team Vyoma is the technical team focused on Unmanned Aerial Vehicles and is one of the most prestigious and respected teams in the entire college. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
